    "global_reference_compared_with_both": [
      "The global reference shows a bright green faceted plant in a golden orange pot. Light gathers in broad warm highlights on the rim and leaf planes, with darker recesses retaining color.",
      "Its softened pot corners and rounded highlight transitions give a compact cartoon volume while the leaf planes stay clearly faceted. Warm orange lit surfaces and deeper brown recesses support depth without fine surface noise.",
      "For this portal, the global reference informs the warm softly lit cartoon character stated in the dispatch; it does not imply copying the plant palette, shape or camera. The portal target retains more intense cyan and gem-like gloss than the global reference."
    ],
    "original": [
      "The original shows an open cyan/aqua ring with two dark navy, sharply faceted feet at the lower sides and a cyan lower arc visible between them.",
